# Lychee link-check exclusions for mayo-clinic-dt-case-study
#
# These URLs are intentionally excluded from automated link checking.
# Each URL is confirmed to exist through manual research but returns
# non-200 status codes to automated bots.
#
# Format: one regex per line (lychee uses Rust regex syntax)

# Mayo Clinic News Network — returns 403 to all automated fetchers.
# This is a deliberate infrastructure choice documented in the project.
https://newsnetwork\.mayoclinic\.org/

# CXOTalk — returns 403 to automated fetchers.
https://www\.cxotalk\.com/

# MIT Sloan Management Review — paywalled; returns 403 or auth redirect.
https://sloanreview\.mit\.edu/

# Trade press and association sites that commonly block automated agents:
https://www\.beckershospitalreview\.com/
https://www\.healthcaredive\.com/
https://www\.fiercehealthcare\.com/
https://www\.healthleadersmedia\.com/
https://www\.ama-assn\.org/

# Reuters — returns 401 to automated fetchers.
https://www\.reuters\.com/

# STAT News — returns 404 to automated fetchers (article may be gated/moved).
https://www\.statnews\.com/
